 "s7:15": "Agentic AI recruiters",
 "s7:16": "The portfolio does the applying.",
 "s7:17": "Recruiting agents read what a student proved, match it to open roles, and run the outreach. The system that trained the student now vouches for them, with evidence.",
 "s7:18": "01",
